  "note": "Election of 15 members of Portrush Urban District Council on 18 May 1955; 20 candidates were nominated and there were no withdrawals. No party labels are printed. Seven new members; two sitting members (D. J. Lee and W. J. M'Michael) were defeated. Only 17 candidates are named in the report, although it says there were 20."
